{"parse":{"title":"特性/灾翼王兽","pageid":7356,"revid":17903,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E7%8E%8B%E5%85%BD&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E7%8E%8B%E5%85%BD&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E7%8E%8B%E5%85%BD&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>灾翼王兽</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.81.BE.E7.BF.BC.E7.8E.8B.E5.85.BD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"灾翼王兽\"><b>灾翼王兽</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 飞行.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/79/fhyjt4j1a1fichl39d8fjkqqc48jvx1.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E9%A3%9E%E8%A1%8C.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/79/fhyjt4j1a1fichl39d8fjkqqc48jvx1.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E9%A3%9E%E8%A1%8C.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/79/fhyjt4j1a1fichl39d8fjkqqc48jvx1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />灾翼王兽\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦攻击前，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">高地优势</span>]效果；飞行距离固定为<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格。<br />✦拥有落水救星，触发时损失<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>生命值，并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#ed7950\">免疫击退</font></span>]，直到下次行动开始。<br />✦受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"守护失效\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">守护失效</font></span></span>]时弱化，并掉落[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">灾兽之翼</font></span>]。<br />✦战斗开始时，获得3层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">信息素</span>]。<br />✦自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>格内，任意[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">灾翼兽</span>]攻击时，消耗1层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">信息素</span>]并进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"援护攻击\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">援护攻击</font></span></span>]；<br />✦任意[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">灾翼兽</span>]被攻击时，进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"援护防御\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">援护防御</font></span></span>]，自身获得2层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">信息素</span>]；<br />✦任意[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">非灾翼兽</span>]被攻击时，消耗1层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">信息素</span>]并进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">援护反击</span>]。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>，免疫所有减益。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E7%8E%8B%E5%85%BD\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/灾翼王兽\"><img alt=\"灾翼王兽 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/82/64pmeax0dwh618618ahxrsoumr7sgvs.png/75px-%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E7%8E%8B%E5%85%BD_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/82/64pmeax0dwh618618ahxrsoumr7sgvs.png/113px-%E7%81%BE%E7%BF%BC%E7%8E%8B%E5%85%BD_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/82/64pmeax0dwh618618ahxrsoumr7sgvs.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022130138\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.092 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.146 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1158/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17272/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4775/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  126.328      1 模板:特性\n100.00%  126.328      1 -total\n 62.58%   79.057      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 57.12%   72.162     15 模板:中括号介绍\n  7.79%    9.842      1 模板:魔物图\n  7.34%    9.269      1 模板:面包屑\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7356-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022130138 and revision id 17903. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div